X_text: '," with steamed basmati rice.<|endoftext|>Title: Chocolate Dip(For Coating Candies) Directions: Melt paraffin in double boiler; add chips. When thoroughly melted and blended, put toothpick in piece of candy and dip into hot chocolate until coated. Place on waxed paper to cool.<|endoftext|>Title: Apple Cake With Caramelscotch Frosting Directions: Combine first four ingredients in mixing bowl. Sift together next three ingredients and add to oil mixture. Fold in apples and nuts. Bake in 350 oven for 35 to 40 minutes.<|endoftext|>Title: Blackberry Bourbon Infusion Directions: Take a clean Mason jar (see note) and place the blackberries inside. Use a muddling stick or wooden spoon to break up the berries a little. This will help them start to macerate and release their juice into your bourbon. Add the bourbon into the jar. Place the livide on tightly, and put the jar in a cool, dark place like a cupboard. Every day, take the jar out and turn it upside down and shake it a little to be sure it distributes properly. Be patient, and find other delicious things to drink in the meantime.'

