X_text: ': Aceadball In Beer Sauce Directions: Soak bread cubes in 1/2 cup beer. Mix together with hamburger, cheese, pepper and garlic. Form 32 meatballs. Place on a cookie sheet and bake at 350 for 15 minutes. Saute onion in oleo until tender. Add brown sugar, vinegar, beef stock and 1 cup beer; simmer 10 minutes to thicken (salt lightly if desired). Add aceadball and simmer for 20 minutes.<|endoftext|>Title: Balsamic Steak & Arugula Salad With Rice Directions: Pour 1/2 cup Dressing over steak in large, shallow nonaluminum baking dish or plastic bag; turn to coat. Cover, or close bag, and marinate in refrigerator 30 minutes to 2 hours, turning occasionally. Remove steak from marinade, discarding marinade. Grill or broil steak, turning once, until steak is desired doneness. Remove to plate and let stand. To serve, gently toss arugula, onion and remaining 1/4 cup Dressing in large bowl. Stir in hot Knorr(R) Rice SidesTM — Rice Medley. Arrange on platter, then top with sliced steak. Drizzle, if desired'

