X_text: ' the remaining 4 burgers. Press slightly around the edges to seal. Cook the burgers over medium heat in a large pan, flipping as little as possible, until done. I actually turned mine down to medium-low and covered it with a lid for a while to make sure the middles cooked as much as the outside. It should take about 5 minutes per side. Mix the mayo with Cholula sauce and spread on the insides of the buns. Add the burgers and top with enchilada sauce, shredded lettuce and pico de gallo.<|endoftext|>Title: Blueberry-Yogurt Muffins Directions: Combine first 5 ingredients in a large bowl. Mix orange juice and next 4 ingredients; stir well. Add to dry ingredients, stirring just until moistened. Gently fold in blueberries. Divide batter evenly among 12 muffin cups coated with Pam vegetable cooking spray. Sprinkle 1 tablespoon sugar evenly over muffins. Bake at 400 for 18 minutes or until golden. Remove from pan immediately. There are 150 calories per muffin.<|endoftext|>Title: Red Beans And Rice Directions: Sort and wash beans; cover with water 2-inches over beans and soak overnight. Add salt pork to beans;'

