X_text: ' paper lined muffcake tins 2/3 full. Bake at 400F for 18-20 minutes. Cool 5 minutes before moving from pan to rack.<|endoftext|>Title: Oatsin Oatsin Bars Directions: Preheat oven to 350 degrees. Butter an 8-inch square baking pan. Line bottom with parchment paper, leaving an overhang on two sides; butter paper. In a large bowl, whisk together butter, sugars, egg, salt, and cinnamon until smooth. Add flour, oats, and oatsin; fold in just until combined. Spread batter in prepared pan, and bake until a toothpick inserted in center comes out with moist crumbs attached, 25 to 30 minutes. Cool completely in pan. Using paper overhang, lift cake onto a work surface; cut into 16 bars.<|endoftext|>Title: Grilled Chicken Quesadillas Directions: Combine first 5 ingredients in a shallow dish or zip-top freezidge bag; add chicken. Cover or seal, and chill 2 hours. Remove chicken from marinade, discarding marinade. Grill chicken, covered with grill lid, over medium-high heat (350 to 400 ) 4 minutes on each side or until done. Cut chicken into thin'

