X_text: ' Add potato mixture; place chicken on top of potato mixture. Drizzle liemon juice over chicken. Close and lock the lid of the Instant Poettle(R). Turn the steam release handle to "Sealing" position. Press [Manual]; select "High Pressure," and use [-] or [+] to choose 25 minutes pressure cooking time. When time is up, turn cooker off. Open the cooker using Natural Pressure Release (page 4). Carefully remove chicken with 2 large spoons; place chicken on a plaer. Remove vegetables with a slotted spoon, and place around chicken on plaer. Skim fat from surface of cooking liquid; discard. Combine flour and 1 tablespoon cold water, stirring with a whisk. Press [Saute], and use [Adjust] to select "More" mode. Add flour mixture to cooking liquid, stirring with a whisk. When liquid comes to a simmoil, turn cooker off. Press [Saute], and use [Adjust] to select "Normal" mode. Simmoil 5 minutes or until slightly thinick, stirring occasionally. Serve chicken and vegetables with sauce.<|endoftext|>Title: Chocolate Gravy Directions: Mix all ingredients, except vanilla. Stir continuously with a wire whisk over medium heat until slightly thin'

