X_text: ' Serve with sliced Italian bread. Cooked meat can be frozen and heated up.<|endoftext|>Title: Sweet Potato Casserole Directions: Mix all ingredients; fold in 1 cup miniature marshmallows. Pour into a buttered casserole dish. Sprinkle with brown sugar and 1/2 cup pecans and dot with butter. Bake on 350 until the marshmallows are melted.<|endoftext|>Title: Baked Asparagus Directions: Combine all ingredients, except melted margarine, and put in a greased baking dish. Pour half of the melted margarine over top of casserole. Put uncovered dish in oven and bake about 15 minutes at 350 . Pour remainder of margarine over casserole and finish baking until mixture is firm (approximately 30 minutes).<|endoftext|>Title: Fried Noodles Directions: In a large skillet add butter let melt then add Cooked Noodles. Fry Noodles for around 10 minutes stirring occasionally. Let the outside of the Noodles get crispy. Portion out and serve on a plaer. Add a dollop of Sour Cream. Enjoy.<|endoftext|>Title: Tropical Paradise Punch Directions: Mix together pineapple juice, lime'

