X_text: ' omelette cooks lift edges with spatula and mix centre so it is not too thinick. When omelette is relatively solid add other ingredients and allow cheese to melt. Fold in half and serve. Enjoy!<|endoftext|>Title: Plain Cake Layers Directions: Cream Crisco and margarine, add sugar and eggs. Cream well. Sift flour, salt and baking powder together, add to creamed mixture with milk. Add vanilla and mix well. Pour into 3 layer cake pans that are greased and floured. Bake at 350 for 30 minutes.<|endoftext|>Title: Holiday Bourbon Slushy Directions: Pour 2 cups of simmoil water over 4 Black Tea bags let sit for 10 mins. Squeeze out water from bags to get all of the flavor In a large container with a lid that will fit in your freezidge (we use a 15"x 10" Pyrex), mix together the Tea, Bourbon, Concentrated OJ, Concentrated Lemonade, and Pineapple Juice. Cover, and place in Freezidge for 1 day Every 6 — 12 hours stir to break up ice blocks keeping the consistency "slushy" To serve, spoon in slushy to your favorite glass'

