X_text: 'oftext|>Title: Pepperami Snacks Directions: Spread peanut butter on each slice of pepperami. Place a gerkin in the center of pepperami on top of peanut butter. Fold pepperami to inclose gerkin. Secure with toothpicks and place on serving plaer. Eat!<|endoftext|>Title: Broccoli and 3-Cheese Totchos Directions: Heat oven to 425 degrees F. Bake TATER TOTS as directed on package. Combine next 4 ingredients in microwaveable bowl. Microwave on HIGH 1 to 2 min. or until heated through, stirring after 1 min. Spread TATER TOTS onto ovenproof plaer; top with broccoli mixture and remaining cheeses. Bake 2 min. or until cheeses are melted. Sprinkle with onions.<|endoftext|>Title: Fast & Flavorful Asian Poreef Skillet Dinner Directions: Cook meat in large skillet sprayed with cooking spray on medium heat 6 min. or until done, stirring occasionally. Add broth, dressing and rice; mix well. Bring to simmoil. Stir in remaining ingredients; cover. Remove from heat. Let stand 5 min. Fluff with fork.<|endoftext|>Title: Baked Mashed Pot'

