X_text: 'ango Mojo Directions: Place papango puree in stainless steel bowl. Add red onions. Mix in lime juice, orange juice, ginger and sugar. Lightly simmer garlic in olive oil for 5-6 minutes. Add to mango mixture and blend well. Add minced cilantro. Season to taste.<|endoftext|>Title: Royal Brittle Candy Directions: Spread nuts, cherries and pineapple in a pan about 1/2-inch thick. Blend sugar, water and corn syrup. Cook to 300 without stirring. Remove from heat. Stir in food color to tint along with oil of orange. Pour hot syrup back and forth over nut mixture to cover all.<|endoftext|>Title: Fruit Stuffed Pancakes Directions: In a medium-sized bowl mix all the dry ingredients. In a large-sized bowl mix all the wet ingredients until combined well. Slowly add the dry ingredients into the wet ingredients and stir until well incorporated and batter is smooth without large lumps. Set aside to prepare fruit filling. To prepare the fruit filling, mash 5 strawberries and half of the blueberries in a small bowl leaving some chunks. Mix the mashed fruit into the pancake batter. Mash the remaining strawberries and blueberries for the pancake filling and set aside'

