X_text: ' January 2 Hopping John Soup Directions: Combine all ingredients in large soup pot and bring to slow boil. Reduce heat, cover and simmer until rice is cooked. Serve with left over corn bread.<|endoftext|>Title: Puppy Chow Directions: Melt peanut butter, chocolate chips and margarine in microwave. Pour over Rice Chex to coat. Put 10x sugar in a paper bag. Pour in coated Rice Chex. Store in airtight container for a good snack.<|endoftext|>Title: Papango Margaritas Directions: Spoon 3 tablespoons mango liquid into a saucer; pour papango and remaining liquid into container of an electric blender. Place sugar in another saucer; dip rims of glasses into mango liquid and then sugar. Set aside. Add limeade concentrate and next 3 ingredients to blender container; process until smooth, stopping once to scrape down sides. Pour half the mixture into a small pitcher and set aside. Add ice to remaining mixture in blender and bring it to 5-cup level; process until slushy, stopping once to scrape down sides. Pour into prepared glasses; repeat with remaining papango mixture and ice. Serve immediately.<|endoftext|>Title: Chicken and Vermicelli Soup with Egg'

