X_text: ', or until the center is firm. To make the whipped cream, beat the cream well with the powdered sugar until reaching the desired consistency. Sprinkle with cinnamon to taste. Serve fresh and sprinkled with more cinnamon.<|endoftext|>Title: Spicy Papango Chicken Directions: 1 — Fry the chicken in the oil 2 — Add curry paste, lime juice, coconut milk, water, stock cube, chutney, stirring until it comes to the boil. Simmer uncovered. 3 — Start cooking your rice. 3 — 5 minutes before your rice is ready add the broccoli, stir through & cover. 4 — 3 minutes before the rice is ready add the peas (leave these on the top to steam) and cover 5 — 1 minute (or earlier if not quite ripe) add the sliced mango & stir through. 6 — Serve.<|endoftext|>Title: Raisin Oat Cookies Directions: Heat oven to 350 . In large bowl, cream butter and both sugars until light and fluffy. Beat in egg and vanilla. Stir together flour, baking powder and salt. Add to creamed mixture. Blend thoroughly. Stir in raisins and oats.<|endoftext|>Title: Bacon Egg Phyllo Mini " Pies" Directions'

