X_text: '|>Title: Maple Toast Bundles Directions: This recipe is for 4. Make as many as you like! Preheat oven to 400 . Grease or spray 4 muffin tins. Take you sandwich bread and roll it flat with a rolling pin. Mix together melted butter and maple syrup. Brush over one side only of bread. Place, syrup side down, into muffin tins until bread is molded into muffin tin shape. Sprinkle with bacon bits and shredded cheese, about 1 tablespoon of each. Carefully crack an egg over top. You can also scramble an egg and pour it over top. Salt and pepper to taste. Loosely tent with foil over the top of the muffin pan and bake for 15 minutes. Check eggs to see if white has hardened but yolk is still soft. Enjoy!<|endoftext|>Title: Mexican Dip Directions: Mix cream cheese and sour cream until smooth. Place in bottom of deep dish pie plate (glass). Spread can of chili on top of mixture. Thinly slice cheese and place over chili. Microwave mixture until cheese melts (approximately 4 to 5 minutes). Dip in your favorite nachos and enjoy!<|endoftext|>Title: Old Fashion Molasses Cookies'


