X_text: ' together diced tomatoes, onions, basil and olive oil in a bowl. Season with salt and pepper. Evenly distribute mozzarella and shredded Parmesan over each bun half. Place in oven for 5 to 7 minutes till cheese melts and starts to brown. Remove from oven. Evenly sprinkle the diced tomato mix over each bun half. Top with balsamic glaze or serve with side of marinara for dipping.<|endoftext|>Title: Barbecued Stew Poreef Directions: Place stew beef into baking dish. After mixing the first 7 ingredients, pour over the meat and cover with metal foil. Bake at 375 for 2 hours.<|endoftext|>Title: Brunch Punch Directions: Prepare frozen apple juice and lemonade according to directions. Mix together in large container. Add almond flavoring. Place ice in large punch bowl, pour juice over ice and add ginger ale just before serving — .<|endoftext|>Title: Pink Punch Directions: Add boiling water to gelatin mix. Stir until dissolved. Add sugar, cold water and fruit juices. (When ready to serve, add ginger ale.) The fruit mix should be chilled. Makes enough for 50 people.<|endoftext|>Title: Slumgull'

