X_text: ', "That\'s rude, little boy." Tim felt bad and said he was sorry. Tim\'s mom told him that it\'s not nice to point and laugh at people. Tim learned his lesson and promised to be kind. From that day on, Tim only waved at people and never pointed again. Everyone liked Tim and they all waved back.<|endoftext|>One day, a little boy named Tim went to the park. He saw an enormous cow. The cow was eating grass. Tim went close to the cow and said, "Hi cow, do you like beef?" The cow looked at Tim and said, "No, I eat grass." Tim wanted to play with the cow. He said, "Let\'s spring and play." The cow was happy and they started to spring and run. They had a lot of fun. They played all day long. But then, something strange happened. The cow started to change. It became a big, colorful bird. Tim was so surprised! The bird said, "I was a bird all along, but a bad witch made me a cow. Your love and fun turned me back into a bird. Thank you, Tim!" Tim and the bird became best friends and played together every day.<|endoftext'

